    "summary": "**Onager Dunecrawler** errata. The **Daedalus missile launcher** makes 2 attacks; the **Eradication beamer** makes 3D3 attacks at Strength 10; the **Neutron laser** makes 3 attacks with Damage D6+2; and the **Twin Onager heavy phosphor blaster** makes 12 attacks. The datasheet also gains **Scuttling Walker**: whenever the model makes a Normal move, an Advance move or a Fall Back move, it may cross friendly **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** models and any terrain feature section 4\" tall or shorter.",
